  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The proposed project will undertake activities that will continue contributing to enhancing the capacity of key beneficiary states and government immigration agencies. The project will focus on the trade corridor between Somalia and Kenya (i.e. between Garissa and El Berde) and up to the Gulf of Aden.</narrative>
